#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Kartesio is a program for calculating best fit curves with experimental "
"points using regression algorithms or neural networks. It is free and "
"licensed under the &GNU; Public License."
msgstr ""
"Kartesio je program za računanje najbolje uklapajuće krive sa "
"eksperimentalnim tačkama korištenjem regresivnih algoritama ili neuralnih "
"mreža. Besplatan je i licenciran pod &GNU; Javnom licencom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Kartesio has a simple interface that allows you to plot points and a curve. "
"The curve is usually calculated by the program, but you can also write it by "
"yourself."
msgstr ""
"Kartesio ima jednostavan interface koji Vam omogućava crtanje tačaka i "
"krive. Krivu obično računa program, ali je možete napisati i sami."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid "Kartesio quick start guide"
msgstr "Kartesio uputstva za brz početak"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As soon as you open Kartesio, you will get a blank table and a blank plot. "
"This is also the same screen you can get in every moment just clicking on "
"(<menuchoice> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem> </"
"menuchoice>). You can try to best fit your experimental points with a "
"regression algorithm or a neural network, using the tools in the appropriate "
"tab. Please note that regression algorithm needs <application>maxima</"
"application> to be installed on your computer, while the neural network "
"method needs ZorbaNeural."
msgstr ""
"Čim otvorite Kartesio, dobit ćete praznu tabelu i prazan nacrt. Ovakav "
"prikaz možete dobiti u svakom trenutku, samo pritisnite na (<menuchoice> "
"<guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Nova</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>). "
"Možete pokušati da najbolje uklopite Vaše eksperimentalne tačke sa "
"regresivnim algoritmom ili neuralnom mrežom, koristeći se alatima u "
"odgovarajućem izborniku. Regresivni algoritam zahtijeva  "
"<application>maxima</application> aplikaciju unaprijed instaliranu na Vašem "
"kompjuteru, dok metod neuralne mreže zahtijeva ZorbaNeural."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Kartesio main window</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Kartesio glavni prozor</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Kartesio main window</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Kartesio glavni prozor</phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid "Regression"
msgstr "Regresija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You should start adding your points to the table. Obviously, a bidimensional "
"point is identified with two coordinates (on X and Y axis)."
msgstr ""
"Trebate početi dodavanjem svojih tačaka u tabelu. Očigledno, "
"dvodimenzionalna tačka je definisana sa dvije koordinate (na X i Y osi)."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Adding points</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Dodavanje tačaka</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Adding points</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Dodavanje tačaka</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Regression</guilabel> tab, you can write a generic function "
"that will be used by Kartesio as a model for the fitting curve. The function "
"must be written with the variables x and y, and with variable coefficients "
"(represented by letters). Obviously, you can also write numeric "
"coefficients. Please take note that the function must be biunique."
msgstr ""
"U<guilabel>Regression</guilabel> tabu, možete pisati generičku funkciju koja "
"će se koristiti u Kartesiu kao model za poklapajuću krivu. Funkcija mora "
"biti napisana sa varijablama x i y, i sa koeficijentima varijabli "
"(predstavljenim slovima). Naravno, možete napisati i koeficijente kao "
"brojeve. Funkcija mora biti bijektivna."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Writing a generic function</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Pisanje generičke funkcije</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Writing a generic function</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Pisanje generičke funkcije</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Clicking the <guibutton>Best fit</guibutton> button, Kartesio will start to "
"calculate coefficients for the function you wrote, trying to best fit the "
"experimental points. The final function will appear the edit box close to "
"the bottom edge of the window."
msgstr ""
"Klikom na  <guibutton>Najbolje poklapanje</guibutton> dugme, Kartesio će "
"početi računanje koeficijenata za funkciju koju ste napisali, pokušavajući "
"da je najbolje uklopi sa eksperimentalnim tačkama. Završna funkcija će se "
"pojaviti u kutiji za ispravljanje u blizini donjeg kraja prozora."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Best fit done</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Najbolje uklapanje završeno</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Best fit done</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Najbolje uklapanje završeno</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After the fit operation, points and the curve will be automatically plotted. "
"Anyway, you may prefer to change to plotted area to see better the image. "
"This can be done using the four spinboxes: <guilabel>X min</guilabel> is the "
"minimum value of X axis, and <guilabel>X max</guilabel> is the maximum "
"value. For example, if you write respectively 0 and 1, then the plot will "
"start from 0 and end to 1. The same logic works for Y axis."
msgstr ""
"Nakon operacije uklapanja, tačke i kriva će automatki biti nacrtane. Ukoliko "
"želite da promjenite nacrtanu oblast da vidite bolju sliku, to možete "
"uraditi korištenjem četiri spin kutije: <guilabel>X min</guilabel> je "
"najmanja vrijednost X ose, i <guilabel>X max</guilabel> je maksimalna "
"vrijednost. Naprimjer, ukoliko napišete respektivno 0 i 1, onda će nacrt "
"početi od 0 a završiti u 1. Ista logika vrijedi i za Y osu."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>A closer look</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Bliži pregled</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>A closer look</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Bliži pregled</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you change plot limits, you may need to change also the resolution: if "
"the resolution of the plot is too little, you will see every curve as a "
"single line. If the resolution is too high you will waste a lot of CPU time "
"to draw the plot."
msgstr ""
"Ako promijenite granice nacrta, možda ćete morati promijeniti i rezoluciju: "
"ako je rezolucija nacrta premala, vidjet ćete svaku krivu kao jedinstvenu "
"liniju. Ako je rezolucija previsoka, potrošit ćete mnogo CPU vremena da "
"nacrtate nacrt."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:127
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Higher resolution</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Veća rezolucija</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Higher resolution</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Veća rezolucija</phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid "Neural Network"
msgstr "Neuralna mreža"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The neural network method works like the regression one, but you can not "
"write you own function: you must choose it from a list. This list, anyway, "
"contains practically every kind of function you may want (periodic functions "
"are not usable with a neural network)."
msgstr ""
"Metod neuralne mreže radi isto kao regresivni algoritam, ali ne možete "
"napisati vlastitu funkciju: morate izabrati neku iz liste. Lista sadrži "
"praktično sve vrste funkcija koje Vam mogu zatrebati (periodične funkcije se "
"ne mogu koristit sa neuralnom mrežom)."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Choosing the correct function</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Izbor prave funkcije</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Choosing the correct function</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Izbor prave funkcije</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Usually, back propagation training is just what you need. For this reason it "
"is checked by default. Just modify the number of iterations (it should not "
"be too high, or the process may end up with way too strange value) and then "
"press the <guibutton>Calculate</guibutton> button. Please take note that the "
"neural network, exactly as a human brain, may give you different results: if "
"you press the <guibutton>Calculate</guibutton> button more than once and you "
"will find out that the network calculates every time a different best "
"fitting curve."
msgstr ""
"Obično, propagacija unatrag je upravo ono što Vam je potrebno. Zbog ovog "
"razloga, to je postavljeno kao zadana vrijednost. Samo izmijenite broj "
"iteracija (ne treba biti prevelik broj, jer ce inace proces završiti sa "
"čudnom vrijednosti) a zatim pritisnite <guibutton>Izračunaj</guibutton> "
"dugme. Neuralna mreža, upravo kao i ljudski mozak, Vam može dati različite "
"rezultate: ako  <guibutton>Izračunaj</guibutton> dugme više od jedanput "
"uvidjet ćete da mreža računa svaki put različitu najbolje uklapajuću krivu."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:154
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Back propagation training</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Propagacija unazad</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Back propagation training</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Propagacija unazad</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are not satisfied by the back propagation training result, you could "
"also use the genetic algorithm training. This can be done simply checking "
"the appropriate checkbox. Genetic algorithm training takes a lot more CPU "
"resources, so you better use a very low iterations number (not more than "
"500)."
msgstr ""
"Ako niste zadovoljni sa rezultatom propagacije unazad, mođete koristiti "
"genetski algoritam. Ovo se moože postići jednostavnim označavanjem "
"odgovarajuće kućice. Genetski algoritam zauzima mnogo više CPU resursa, pa "
"je bolje da koristite veoma male brojeve za iteracije (ne veće od 500)."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Genetic algorithm training</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Treniranje genetskog algoritma</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Genetic algorithm training</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Treniranje genetskog algoritma</phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid "Other useful things"
msgstr "Ostale korisne stvari"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sometimes it is useful to redraw the plot. For example, it is if you have "
"manually changed the best fitting curve or if you edited some points and you "
"don't want to recalculate the fitting function. Just use the <guibutton>Draw "
"Plot</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Ponekad je korisno ponovo nacrtati nacrt. Naprimjer, ako ste ručno "
"promijenili najbolje uklapajuću krivu ili ste izmijenili neke tačke i ne "
"želite da ponovo računate uklapajuću funkciju, samo koristite <guibutton> "
"Nacrtajte Nacrt</guibutton>  dugme."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Draw plot</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Nacrtaj nacrt</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Draw plot</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Nacrtaj nacrt</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:188
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To know how much the fitting curve is different from your experimental "
"points, you can look at the root mean square error. To add it to the plot, "
"it is needed to check the checkbox <guilabel>Show RMS error</guilabel>. Then "
"press the <guibutton>Draw Plot</guibutton> button to redraw the plot: it "
"should contain a red label with the RMS error."
msgstr ""
"Da saznate razliku između uklapajuće krive i Vaših eksperimentalnih tačaka, "
"možete pogledati u srednju kvadratnu pogrešku. Da je dodate u nacrt, mora "
"biti čekirana u kutiji za čekiranje <guilabel>Prikaži Srednju kvadratnu "
"grešku</guilabel>. Onda pritisnite  <guibutton>Nacrtaj Nacrt</guibutton> "
"dugme za ponovno crtnje nacrta: treba da sadrži crvenu oznaku sa SK greškom."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:193
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Showing RMS error</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Prikaz SK greške</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Showing RMS error</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Prikaz SK greške</phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:203
#, no-c-format
msgid "Questions and Answers"
msgstr "Pitanja i odgovori"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:208
#, no-c-format
msgid "Will I ever have to pay for Kartesio?"
msgstr "Da li ću ikad morati plaćati za Kartesio?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:211
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"No, never. Kartesio is licensed under the <ulink url=\"http://www.gnu.org/"
"licenses/licenses.html#GPL\">GPL</ulink>, so you will never have to pay for "
"this program."
msgstr ""
"Ne, nikad. Kartesio je lincenciran pod <ulink url=\"http://www.gnu.org/"
"licenses/licenses.html#GPL\">GPL</ulink>, tako da nikad nećete morati "
"platiti za ovaj program."

#. Tag: title
